# Without this, `COPY web/ .` drags the host's node_modules into the image and
# pnpm aborts ("ERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY") rather than wipe a
# modules dir it did not create. CI never hits it — a fresh checkout has no
# node_modules — but `make docker` on the laptop does.
**/node_modules
web/dist
build
.git
*.md
